<ProfileLayout title="Privacy | Tariq Naseeb" description="Privacy information for the Tariq Naseeb profile website.">
  <main class="section section-white"><div class="container section-head"><p class="section-label">Privacy</p><h1>Clear handling for business conversations.</h1><p>When you use the inquiry form, we collect the details you choose to send: name, company, email, phone, country, inquiry type and message.</p><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>We use form data only to understand and respond to your business inquiry, coordinate follow-up and maintain a reliable record of the conversation.</p><h2>Processing and retention</h2><p>The website is hosted by Vercel and inquiry email is processed through Resend. We aim to retain inquiry records for up to 12 months unless a longer period is required for an active business relationship or legal obligation.</p><h2>Your requests</h2><p>You may ask us to access, correct or delete information you submitted by emailing <a href="mailto:Tariqnaseeb@yiwutariq.com">Tariqnaseeb@yiwutariq.com</a>.</p><p>Contact: Room 902, Building 4, Block A, Zhongfu Plaza, Yiwu City (义乌市中福广场A组团4栋902室).</p></div></main>
</ProfileLayout>
